WEBVTT

00:10:28.082 --> 00:10:31.001
This is an obtainable, feasible solution.

00:10:32.544 --> 00:10:35.464
And number three, innovate.

00:10:35.506 --> 00:10:36.799
Stage is set.

00:10:38.092 --> 00:10:40.969
Developments and data,
computational power,

00:10:41.011 --> 00:10:42.554
water resource management

00:10:42.596 --> 00:10:44.848
have opened the door for advancements.

00:10:45.891 --> 00:10:48.018
But this isn’t just
an issue for engineering;

00:10:48.018 --> 00:10:49.770
this includes all of us.

00:10:51.271 --> 00:10:56.527
Arts, education, biology, chemistry,
urban planning, public health, governance,

00:10:56.527 --> 00:10:58.320
business, all of us.